hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"55","[AI-translation] Behtareen din jis par sooraj tulua hua Jumme ka din hai. Is mein Aadam ki paidaish hui, aur is mein Jannah mein dakhil kiya gaya, aur is mein us se nikala gaya, aur Qayamat qayam nahi hogi magar Jumme ke din."
"56","[AI-translation] Ibn Mas'ud Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Surah Tabaarak Qabr ke azaab se bachane wali hai."
"57","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Quraan ki ek surah jisme tees aayat hain, us ne ek shakhs ki shifa'at ki yahan tak ke us ki magfirat kar di gayi, aur wo Surah Tabaarak Allazi Biyadihil Mulk hai."
